WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.714
In tutorial 10.3, you'll top up
your credits, find your invoices,

00:00:10.764 --> 00:00:12.596
and set your own monthly limits.

00:00:13.626 --> 00:00:16.331
First, click Buy credits
at the top of Credits.

00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:18.097
It takes you straight to the packs.

00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:22.433
Choose the pack you need, and click Buy.

00:00:25.605 --> 00:00:28.905
Add a purchase-order number
or a note if you need one.

00:00:28.955 --> 00:00:32.691
Then click Send request, and
the Alaventra team confirms it.

00:00:33.675 --> 00:00:36.875
Your requests shows each
request with its status.

00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:41.718
A new one says Waiting for confirmation,
and until then, you can click Cancel.

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:47.490
Next, once the payment is confirmed,
the invoice appears under Invoices,

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.000
and it's e-mailed to
your owners and admins.

00:00:50.994 --> 00:00:54.137
Click PDF to download a
copy for your records.

00:00:56.515 --> 00:01:00.050
Finally, Limits caps what
your company uses each month.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:05.236
Only your company's owner can set limits,
while owners and admins can buy credits.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:09.469
Type an on-demand limit
for the analyses you start.

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:15.245
Then type an autopilot limit for
your websites' automatic work.

00:01:15.295 --> 00:01:17.435
Leave a box empty for no limit.

00:01:18.695 --> 00:01:23.420
Keep credits for autopilot stops your own
analyses from using what your weekly work

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:26.449
still needs. Then click Save limits.

00:01:27.457 --> 00:01:31.882
Analyses that would pass your limit
can't start until the 1st of the month,

00:01:31.932 --> 00:01:34.649
and automatic work
pauses at its own limit.

00:01:35.658 --> 00:01:40.609
So, buy a pack and send the request, find
the invoice, and set your monthly limits.

00:01:42.158 --> 00:01:44.733
You're in control of your credits. Next,

00:01:44.783 --> 00:01:48.284
deliver reports on a
schedule in tutorial 10.4.
